From 0071c2da093fd8dc1f511381337d111916786a56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 03:16:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: document the media pipeline and app config

Add KDoc to MediaFetcher (how Gallery discovers folders and loads/sorts/groups
media across the OTG, pre-scoped-storage, and Android 11+ MediaStore access
paths) and to Config, the canonical example of an app extending Commons
BaseConfig with app-specific settings. Comment-only.
---
 .../org/fossify/gallery/helpers/Config.kt     |  8 +++++
 .../fossify/gallery/helpers/MediaFetcher.kt   | 35 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 43 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/gallery/helpers/Config.kt b/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/gallery/helpers/Config.kt
index 5ea55c1d0..eaa7b41f0 100644
--- a/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/gallery/helpers/Config.kt
